      "content": "i get that, but i dont want to bother my doctor for something \"small\" like sleep issues and i don't have an appointment for like three weeks. i've heard of people taking them together all the time though. like, isn't benadryl just a basic antihistamine? it shouldn't be that big of a deal to just take one pill so i can catch some Zs.",
